OL,3,GNEWSASamba the missing capybara caught
OL,4,Aon camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew pictures have emerged of a missing
OL,7,Fcapybara that escaped from a zoo more
OL,8,Fthan six months ago.
OL,10,FMarwell Zoo, near Winchester in
OL,11,FHampshire, is still trying to recover
OL,12,Fone-year-old Samba, who attracted
OL,13,Fglobal interest after she went on the
OL,14,Frun in March.
OL,16,FGrainy images were captured this month
OL,17,Fafter wildlife cameras were set up
OL,18,Ffollowing her last sighting in August.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
