OL,3,GNEWSASamba the missing capybara caught
OL,4,Aon camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamba escaped from the zoo on 17 March,
OL,7,Fless than a day after arriving. She
OL,8,Fbroke out of a temporary enclosure she
OL,9,Fshared with her sister, Tango, who was
OL,10,Fquickly recaptured.
